{'symbol': 'UAL', 'date': '2021-05-21 12:49:00', 'title': "UNITED AIRLINES APPLAUDS SPAIN'S DECISION TO REOPEN TO VACCINATED TRAVELERS", 'text': "CHICAGO, MAY 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNITED\xa0AIRLINES APPLAUDS SPAIN FOLLOWING ITS DECISION TO REOPEN TRAVEL TO VACCINATED VISITORS BEGINNING JUNE 7. THE ANNOUNCEMENT COMES FOLLOWING\xa0THE EUROPEAN UNION COUNCIL'S\xa0FORMAL RECOMMENDATION THAT EU MEMBER STATES CAN REOPEN TO FULLY VACCINATED TOURISTS AND\xa0UNITED LOOKS FORWARD TO WELCOMING BACK CUSTOMERS ON OVER 30 DAILY FLIGHTS\xa0TO 16 DESTINATIONS IN EUROPE\xa0THIS SUMMER, INCLUDING SERVICE BETWEEN NEW YORK/NEWARK AND BARCELONA AND MADRID."}